      "Golden West Airlines\nEffective April 25, 1971\nCON.\nLEAVE ARRIVE FLT. FREQ.\nVIA ST.\nLEAVE ARRIVE FLT. FREQ.\nCATALINA ISLAND\n(Sea Plane Service)\nAvalon Bay to LONG BEACH\n$8.64\n8:30A\n8:50A\n9:30A\n9:50A\n10:30A 10:50A\n11:30A 11:50A\n12:30P 12:50P\n1:30P\n1:50P\n2:50P\n3:30P\n4:30P\n5:30P\n6:30P\n3:50P\n4:50P\n5:50P\n6:50P\n8 Daily\n12 Daily\n16 Daily\n20 Daily\n24 Daily\n28 Daily\n32\nDaily\nDaily\nDaily\n44 Daily\n48 Daily\nKOUR\n9:00A\n10:00A 10:20A\n11:00A 11:20A\n12:00N 12:20P\n1:00P\n1:20P\n2:00P\n3:00P\n4:00P\n5:00P\n6:00P\n3:20P\n4:20P\n5:20P\n6:20P\nLONG BEACH to Avalon Bay\n7 Daily\n11 Daily\n15 Daily\n19 Daily\n23 Daily\n27 Daily\nDaily\n35\nDaily\nDaily\n43 Daily\n47 Daily\nTwo Harbors to LONG BEACH\n$8.64\nLONG BEACH to Two Harbors\n9:40A 10:00A\n4:40P\n5:00P\n54 Daily\n56 Daily\n9:10A\n4:10P\n9:30A\n53 Daily\n4:30P\n55 Daily\nCATALINA ISLAND\n(Twin Otter Service)\nAirport-in-the-Sky to LONG BEACH\n495000\n0• 7:10P\n7:30P\n00•7,560\n8:15P\n75\n93\nTu\nFr.Su\n$12.30*\nLONG BEACH to Airport-in-the-Sky\n•• 4:30P\n4:50P\n••• 7:30P\n7:50P\n•• 6:40P\n7.00P\nMn. We\nFr.Su\nAirport-in-the-Sky to LOS ANGELES\n$14.00\nLOS ANGELES to Airport-in-the-Sky\n••11:30A 11:50A\n••12:00N 12:20P\n9°5.00P\n•° 5:30P\n5:50P\n19 7.100\n7:55P\n• 7:55P\n8038P\n•• 7:55P\n8:15P\n71\nMo thru Sa\nSU\nMo,We\nTh.sa\n93\nFr.Su\n•* 8:30A\n8:50A\n0011:00A 11:20A\n**11:35A 11:55A\n00 4-05P\n.95P\n•• 4:05P\n4:50P\nФ• 6.15Р\n7:00P\n00 6:15P\n6:25P\n••• 7:05Р 7:50P\nMo\nMo thru Sa\nTh Ca\nMo We\nFr.Su\nAirport-in-the-Sky to SANTA ANA\n•• 8:55A\n•• 8:45A\n9:05A\n00 200 1\n4:50P\n•• 6:40P\n7:00P\nFr.Sa,Su\nTh,Sa\n$12.84*\nSANTA ANA to Airport-in-the-Sky\n0º 8.20A\n5:05P\n5:25P\n00 7.20P\n7.50P\n85\nTh,Sa\nFr,Su\nTood, Tisning and tun in the sun.\n• Catalina/Golden West welcomes your freight shipments - Daily\nALL flights - for special requirements, freight charters available.\n•INCLUDES $1.50 SCENIC TOUR\n••EFFECTIVE JUNE 15\n•••DISCONTINUE JUNE 15\nALL FARES INCLUDE 8% FEDERAL TRANSPORTATION TAX\n4.25.1971\nCatalina dsland\nVia...\nCATALINA\nAIR LINES\nCatalina\nBy Air\nFrom\nLos Angeles\nLong Beach\nand now\nOrange County\nAirport\n(Santa Ana)\n• SANTA ROSA\nSAN FRANCISCO\nPALO ALTO\nSAN JOSE\n• MONTEREY\nCANTA RARRARA\nOXNARD\nLONANSSNATONAR\nLONG BEACH\nCATALINA ISLAND\n• TWO HARBORS\nADA THIN THIS SK\n• AVALON\nMOJAVE\nPALMDALE/LANCASTER\nCI MANTE\nPASADENA\nONTARIO\n_ COLTON/SAN BERNARDINO\n- RIVERSIDE\nPALM SPRINGS\n- SHIT CRTON\n- SANTA ANA\nMOJAVE\nPALMDALE/LANCASTER\nPROPOSED\nCATALINA AIR LINES Division of Golden West Airlines, is the world's\nmost experienced commuter airline. We're proud of our fifteen years\nof service to Santa Catalina Island. More than 1,000,000 people have\nflown with us between Catalina and the Mainland!\nRESERVATIONS \u0026 INFORMATION\nLong Beach\n. (213) 421-8281\nLos Angeles\n(213) 636-2121\nOrange County\n(714) 827-7700\nCatalina Island\n.....Avalon 385\nFor Information on Charter Flights call ...\n35M/4-71\n(213) 873-7032 (714) 546-6570\n2005.132.016.003\n..0...\nCatalina Airlines Golden West Airlines"
